*Usage note: ''This masculine word is irregular. '''Ljudi''' (people, men) is the plural form of the singular word '''čovek''' (man).  Because of the existence of dual grammatical numbers in Serbian, the dual form (the form for 2, 3, and 4) is '''čoveka'''.  The dual numbers also apply to any higher numbers ending in 2, 3, and 4, such as 22, 23, and 24.''
